# Hodl Script - Advanced Timelock with Emergency Escape
# This script implements a "hodl" mechanism with an emergency escape clause
# Funds can be spent normally after timelock OR with a penalty before timelock

# Redeem Script:
# Option 1 (Normal unlock after timelock):
OP_IF
    <locktime> OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY OP_DROP <owner_pubkey> OP_CHECKSIG
OP_ELSE
    # Option 2 (Emergency unlock with penalty - requires additional signature)
    2 <owner_pubkey> <penalty_pubkey> 2 OP_CHECKMULTISIG
OP_ENDIF

# Example implementation:
# Normal unlock after September 10, 2025 OR emergency 2-of-2 multisig
OP_IF
    1757462400 OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY OP_DROP 0279be667ef9dcbbac55a06295ce870b07029bfcdb2dce28d959f2815b16f81798 OP_CHECKSIG
OP_ELSE
    2 0279be667ef9dcbbac55a06295ce870b07029bfcdb2dce28d959f2815b16f81798 03f9308a019258c31049344f85f89d5229b531c845836f99b08601f113bce036f9388 2 OP_CHECKMULTISIG
OP_ENDIF